        "- Step 3: wrap the code inside a function\n",
        "- Step 4: turn global variables inside the function into parameters\n",
        "- Step 5: add a docstring and tests as needed\n",
        "\n",
        "<!--\n",
        "```python\n",
        "# 1. Solve for a specific example\n",
